cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these reference outputs or the harness that generates them, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "terrame-goldens: Reference Execution Outputs of the TerraME ca, sysdyn and logo Packages"
abstract: >-
  Reference execution outputs (goldens) of the models of the TerraME 2.0.1 packages
  (cellular automata of the ca package, system dynamics of the sysdyn package and agent-based models of the logo package), with fixed package commits,
  seeds and SHA-256 hashes, and the harness that regenerates them in the terrame-docker image.
  They are used to verify the DisSModel extensions dissmodel-ca, dissmodel-sysdyn and
  dissmodel-abm against TerraME itself.
version: 0.1.0
